      <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #64748b; max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto 16px auto; line-height: 1.5;">
        None of the institutional tools in the directory are specifically categorized for this combination. Try choosing additional intended uses or browse the entire SIT EdTech Directory.
      </p>
